  <text xml:base="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0424.adelon_dramaton.meineke1840-grc1" xml:lang="grc"><body n="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0424.adelon_dramaton.meineke1840-grc1" xml:lang="grc"><div type="edition" n="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0424.adelon_dramaton.meineke1840-grc1" xml:lang="grc" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0424_adelon_dramaton"><head>ΑΔΗΛΩΝ ΔΡΑΜΑΤΩΝ</head><pb n="536" facs="urn:hathi:hvd.32044079388682:scan:540" />
            <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="1" ana="#compiled-citation-normalized" xml:id="meineke-0424-adelon_dramaton-1">
              <head>I.</head>
              <quote>
                <lg>
                  <l n="1" xml:id="meineke-0424-adelon_dramaton-1-l1">Ὅταν δανείζῃ τις πονηρῷ χρήματα</l>
                  <l n="2" xml:id="meineke-0424-adelon_dramaton-1-l2">ἀνήρ, δικαίως ἀντὶ τῶν τόκων ἔχει</l>
                  <l n="3" xml:id="meineke-0424-adelon_dramaton-1-l3">λύπας.</l>
                </lg>
              </quote>
              <note type="source">Stobaeus Floril. II 2 cum lemmate Ἀξινίκου (sic).</note>
              <note type="apparatus">Vs. 1 δανείζῃ Α. δανείζει vulgo. Altero versu legebatur ἀνήρ, δικαίως αὐτῶν τὸν τόκον λύπας ἔχει. Grotius ἀνὴρ δικαίως τὸν τόκον λύπας ἔχει. Recepit hoc Gaisfordius. Mihi potior visa est codicis Marciani lectio apud Gaisfordium Praef. Stob. p. VI. quam totam repraesentavi, nisi quod ἔχει λύπας scripsi pro λύπας ἔχει. Fortasse tamen ἀνὴρ delendum versusque ita scribendus est: δίκαιος, ἀντὶ τῶν τόκων λύπας ἔχει.</note>
            </div>
            <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="2" ana="#compiled-citation-normalized" xml:id="meineke-0424-adelon_dramaton-2">
              <head>II.</head>
              <note type="source">Etymol. M. p. 775 30: <quote>Ὑϊκὸν δέρμα οὐχ εὕρηται ἐν χρήσει εἰ μὴ παρὰ Ἀξιονίκῳ. οὐδέποτε γὰρ λέξις σημαίνουσα μέρος σώματος ἔχει εἰς κον κτητικόν, ἀλλὰ διὰ καθαροῦ τοῦ ον. οὐ γὰρ λέγομεν χοιρικὸν κρέας ἀλλὰ χοίρειον.</quote> Eadem Philemo Gramm. p. 172 ed. Osann.</note>
            </div>
          <pb n="707" facs="urn:hathi:hvd.32044079388682:scan:709" />
            <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="1_2" fragment_number="1" author_heading="AXIONICUS" ends_on_page="true" ana="#compiled-duplicate-number #compiled-citation-normalized" xml:id="meineke-0424-adelon_dramaton-1_2">
              <lg>
                <l n="1" xml:id="meineke-0424-adelon_dramaton-1_2-l1">ictus tum ferre didici digitorum, ossuum</l>
                <l n="2" xml:id="meineke-0424-adelon_dramaton-1_2-l2">et poculorum, tanto impactos impetu</l>
                <l n="3" xml:id="meineke-0424-adelon_dramaton-1_2-l3">ut octo minimum saepe ferrem vulnera:</l>
                <l n="4" xml:id="meineke-0424-adelon_dramaton-1_2-l4">atque id erat conducibile. nam sibi subditum</l>
                <l n="5" xml:id="meineke-0424-adelon_dramaton-1_2-l5">me habet voluptas. maior experientia</l>
                <l n="6" xml:id="meineke-0424-adelon_dramaton-1_2-l6">monstravit aliud conducibile quod foret.</l>
                <l n="7" xml:id="meineke-0424-adelon_dramaton-1_2-l7">siquis rixosus mecum amat contendere,</l>
                <l n="8" xml:id="meineke-0424-adelon_dramaton-1_2-l8">ad eum me verto, quaeque in me profuderat</l>
                <l n="9" xml:id="meineke-0424-adelon_dramaton-1_2-l9">maledicta vera fateor. ita vito malum.</l>
                <l n="10" xml:id="meineke-0424-adelon_dramaton-1_2-l10">sceleratus aliquis esse se dicit probum?</l>
                <l n="11" xml:id="meineke-0424-adelon_dramaton-1_2-l11">hunc ego collaudo et magnam refero gratiam.</l>
                <l n="12" xml:id="meineke-0424-adelon_dramaton-1_2-l12">glaucum hodie coctum si comesse inceperim,</l>
                <l n="13" xml:id="meineke-0424-adelon_dramaton-1_2-l13">eius reliquias cras comesse non piget:</l>
                <l n="14" xml:id="meineke-0424-adelon_dramaton-1_2-l14">tale est ingenium, mores sunt tales mihi.</l>
              </lg>
            </div>
            <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="2_2" fragment_number="2" author_heading="AXIONICUS" ana="#compiled-duplicate-number #compiled-citation-normalized" xml:id="meineke-0424-adelon_dramaton-2_2">
              <head>EX FABULA INCERTA.</head>
              <lg>
                <l n="1" xml:id="meineke-0424-adelon_dramaton-2_2-l1">Quoties probus vir improbo pecuniam</l>
                <l n="2" xml:id="meineke-0424-adelon_dramaton-2_2-l2">credit, dolorem recipit usurae loco.</l>
              </lg>
            </div>
          </div></body></text></TEI>